# Dance Maniax 2nd Mix (G*A39 VER. JAA), Konami 2000: the first boot's install, from blank NVRAM with MAME's current cassette dump (the game
# cassette is in; no install cassette). NOTE 604 asks for Test to update the CD-ROM drive's firmware (by frame 300): Test at 600, and the version-up passes at once. It installs itself from the CD to the onboard
# flash, and by frame ~9000 shows INFO 508: install done, note the certificate number and
# power-cycle. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare HIRAKU's
# 573 core with MAME through the install.
game dmx2m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)
at 600 press "Service Mode" 8   # NOTE 604: start the CD-ROM drive's version-up
from 0 every 60 snap
at 9900 quit
